---
// Picture first for "Indexes for words and meaning": three kinds of question, the
// index built for each, and one example. The "limits" and "close my account" examples
// are the ones used in the post's text. Plain inline SVG with site tokens, no ids.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
import type { DiagramIconName } from '../../data/diagram-icons';

const W = 900;
const H = 372;
type Card = {
  x: number;
  icon: DiagramIconName;
  qEn: string[];
  qVi: string[];
  iEn: string[];
  iVi: string[];
  exEn?: string[];
  exVi?: string[];
  mono?: string;
};
const cards: Card[] = [
  {
    x: 20, icon: 'key',
    qEn: ['Find this key,', 'or keys in a range'],
    qVi: ['Tìm khoá này,', 'hoặc khoá trong khoảng'],
    iEn: ['B-tree or LSM-tree', 'sorted by key'],
    iVi: ['B-tree hoặc LSM-tree', 'sắp theo khoá'],
    mono: 'user_id = 42',
  },
  {
    x: 314, icon: 'search',
    qEn: ['Find a word or', 'a fragment of text'],
    qVi: ['Tìm một từ hoặc', 'một mẩu văn bản'],
    iEn: ['Inverted index', 'term → documents'],
    iVi: ['Inverted index', 'term → tài liệu'],
    mono: 'limits in rate_limits_v2',
  },
  {
    x: 608, icon: 'model',
    qEn: ['Find documents', 'by meaning'],
    qVi: ['Tìm tài liệu', 'theo ý nghĩa'],
    iEn: ['Vector index', 'nearest vectors, approximate'],
    iVi: ['Index vector', 'vector gần nhất, gần đúng'],
    exEn: ['"how do I close my account"', 'finds "cancelling your subscription"'],
    exVi: ['"làm sao đóng tài khoản"', 'tìm ra "huỷ gói đăng ký"'],
  },
];
const cw = 272;
---
<figure class="tq">
  <div class="tq-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Three kinds of question and the index built for each. Find a key or a range: B-tree or LSM-tree. Find a word or fragment of text: inverted index. Find documents by meaning: vector index.">
    <text x="20" y="24" class="tq-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Three questions, three indexes</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Ba câu hỏi, ba loại index</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="20" y="46" class="tq-sub">
      <tspan data-lang-en>The first is what the earlier sections covered. This section covers the other two.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Loại đầu là những gì các phần trước đã nói. Phần này nói hai loại còn lại.</tspan>
    </text>

    {cards.map((c, i) => (
      <g>
        <rect x={c.x} y="66" width={cw} height="84" rx="4" class="tq-box" />
        <DiagramIcon name={c.icon} x={c.x + 32} y={108} size={34} />
        <text x={c.x + 66} y="100" class="tq-in">
          <tspan data-lang-en>{c.qEn[0]}</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>{c.qVi[0]}</tspan>
        </text>
        <text x={c.x + 66} y="120" class="tq-in">
          <tspan data-lang-en>{c.qEn[1]}</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>{c.qVi[1]}</tspan>
        </text>

        <path d={`M${c.x + cw / 2},150 L${c.x + cw / 2},177`} class="tq-arrow" />
        <polygon points={`${c.x + cw / 2 - 5},176 ${c.x + cw / 2 + 5},176 ${c.x + cw / 2},184`} class="tq-head" />

        <rect x={c.x} y="184" width={cw} height="72" rx="4" class="tq-box is-hit" />
        <text x={c.x + 16} y="212" class="tq-in">
          <tspan data-lang-en>{c.iEn[0]}</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>{c.iVi[0]}</tspan>
        </text>
        <text x={c.x + 16} y="234" class="tq-in-m">
          <tspan data-lang-en>{c.iEn[1]}</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>{c.iVi[1]}</tspan>
        </text>

        <rect x={c.x} y="272" width={cw} height="56" rx="4" class="tq-ex" />
        {c.mono ? (
          <text x={c.x + 16} y="305" class="tq-mono">{c.mono}</text>
        ) : (
          <>
            <text x={c.x + 16} y="296" class="tq-in-s">
              <tspan data-lang-en>{c.exEn![0]}</tspan>
              <tspan data-lang-vi>{c.exVi![0]}</tspan>
            </text>
            <text x={c.x + 16} y="314" class="tq-in-s">
              <tspan data-lang-en>{c.exEn![1]}</tspan>
              <tspan data-lang-vi>{c.exVi![1]}</tspan>
            </text>
          </>
        )}
      </g>
    ))}

    <text x="20" y="356" class="tq-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>All three are built from the same parts: sorted files, logs and background merging.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Cả ba đều ghép từ những mảnh quen thuộc: file đã sắp xếp, log và việc trộn chạy nền.</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Pick the index by the kind of question, not by habit. Top row: the question. Middle: the index. Bottom: an example.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Chọn index theo loại câu hỏi, đừng theo thói quen. Hàng trên: câu hỏi. Giữa: loại index. Dưới: ví dụ.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .tq { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .tq-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .tq svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .tq text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .tq .tq-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .tq .tq-sub { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .tq-box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .tq-box.is-hit { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .tq-ex { fill: none; stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .tq .tq-in { font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .tq .tq-in-m { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .tq .tq-in-s { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .tq .tq-mono { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .tq .tq-note { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .tq-arrow { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .tq-head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .tq figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
